}

{1 Service packages}

The adapters defined here power service-specific packages that implement
individual AWS APIs:

{ul
  {li {{:../awskit-s3/index.html}[awskit-s3]} — Amazon S3 client (objects, buckets,
    multipart uploads, presigned URLs, policies, simulation)}
}
